# Certificate and key material: never committed. The embedded IEEE
# 2030.5 server's default cert directory (config.defaultSEP2ServerCertDir,
# "./sep2-certs") is relative to the working directory, so running the
# bridge from the repo root with no override would otherwise write real
# server and device key material into the checkout.
/sep2-certs/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cer
*.csr
*.p12
*.pfx
*.x509

# Log files
*.log
